From 04ffcb2594e00924c64274df2c0aa9db5a2de2bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tsuji-riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:04:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] mtd: rawnand: add Celestial CNC1800L NAND controller, SPI
 and flash DT

Add an exec_op based raw NAND driver for the CNC1800L controller. The
ECC scheme follows the standard NAND properties: the default is the SoC
1-bit Hamming engine in the vendor on-flash format (3 bytes per 512
bytes), generic soft ECC (Hamming/BCH) can be selected from the device
tree. Describe the Designware SSI SPI controller (16 bit register
accesses) with a spi-nor flash, add NAND partitions and a second DTS
using software BCH.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1YEf8BfFQRcvUTgm7e5vZ
